cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SciDataMAS, please cite the software and the papers listed below."
title: "SciDataMAS: LLM-Driven Multi-Agent Systems for Scientific Data Management"
abstract: >-
  SciDataMAS is a research prototype that applies large language models to
  scientific data management: adaptive metadata generation, DAG-augmented
  provenance metadata, LLM-based schema harmonization, debate-driven metadata
  quality estimation, and natural-language retrieval over a data lake. This
  repository contains the research code, the curated data and the experiment
  harness, together with the SciDataMAS plugin for DeepSeek Harness.
